OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Stones faces trial over
OL,4,Aalleged motoring offence
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngland defender John Stones faces
OL,7,Ftrial in 2028 over an allegation he
OL,8,Ffailed to provide driver information to
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FThe 32-year-old footballer, who left
OL,12,FManchester City for Inter Milan this
OL,13,Fsummer, is alleged to have driven his
OL,14,F#150,000 Range Rover at 58mph (93km/h)
OL,15,Fin a 50mph zone on the M60 in March
OL,16,F2026.
OL,18,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said
OL,19,FStones did not respond to two letters
OL,20,Fand on 27 April was charged with
OL,21,Ffailing to furnish driver information.
OL,22,FHe has since pleaded not guilty.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
