OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Stones faces trial over
OL,4,Aalleged motoring offence
OL,5,
OL,6,FStones is represented by Freeman & Co
OL,7,FSolicitors, a law firm whose owner Nick
OL,8,FFreeman has advised several celebrity
OL,9,Fclients in motoring cases and has
OL,10,Ftrademarked his nickname of Mr
OL,11,FLoophole.
